      "created_at": "2015-02-16T19:06:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey folks,</p><p>I've flipped around and not been able to find a definitive answer on this one. If Kismet has put her talisman on a hero and that hero gets incapacitated, what happens to the amulet? We checked everything and nothing I could see said that it should go back to Kismet. It's treated like a character card (that we did find in the errata), but do we really get X free turns while Kismet pounds away at an amulet that's on a downed character? That doesn't seem at all fair, but considering that we have 7 jinxes on the table, nobody was complaining about the respite...</p><p>Any thoughts?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:45.586Z",
